  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_koopa_end_01#2",
   "label": "MES_EV_MAIN_SKoopa_last_Ending_22",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00]クリッキーに ヘイファー\nパタボン！！[0002:0001:][Next]オマエ[Ruby 達;たち] まだいたのか！\nはやく [Ruby 出;で]ていけ！[0002:0001:]"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_koopa_end_01#3",
   "label": "MES_EV_MAIN_SKoopa_last_Ending_23",
   "style": 5,
   "attr": "00000000",
